  "title": "Beta Bionics Updates Commercialization Timeline Expectations for Mint™, its Patch Pump in Development",
  "summary": "IRVINE, Calif., May 21, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Beta Bionics, Inc. (Nasdaq: BBNX), a pioneering leader in the development of advanced diabetes management solutions, today announced that it expects to fully commercialize Mint by the end of the second quarter of 2027, subject to regulatory clearance",
